=== DELEGATION CHAIN (PM → Lead → Coder) ===
demo-dlg-root: owner=human-dispatch oversight_by=human-dispatch reserved=1000 remaining-for-children=400
demo-dlg-lead: owner=pm-01 oversight_by=pm-01 reserved=600 remaining-for-children=200
demo-dlg-coder: owner=lead-01 oversight_by=lead-01 reserved=400 remaining-for-children=400
depth of coder delegation: 3 (limit 5)

=== REJECTED: over-reservation (400 > lead remaining 200) ===
BUDGET_EXCEEDED: reservation 400 exceeds parent demo-dlg-lead remaining budget 200; budget is reserved from the parent, not copied from the total

=== REJECTED: scope superset (adds path:/etc) ===
SCOPE_VIOLATION: child scope must be a subset of parent scope ["project:crm","path:/workspace/crm","tool:shell.exec"]; got ["project:crm","path:/workspace/crm","path:/etc"]

=== HANDOFF: lead-01 hands execution to coder-01 ===
before: owner=lead-01, oversight_by=lead-01
after:  owner=coder-01, oversight_by=lead-01 (supervision stays with delegator)
scope subset helper: true
